  "description": "Engineered for fun, confidence and control, the Vitus 24 is all this and more.\n\nThe 24 is built around an easy-to-ride lightweight 6061-T6 aluminium frameset. Complemented by an 8 speed Shimano Acera drivetrain, with thumbshifter to allow effortless gear changing.\n\nShimano's Acera components offer dedicated MTB features, easy gearshifts, and solid performance. With tough anti-rust parts that handle the rigors of teenage cycling, continuing to perform time after time, with minimal maintenance\n\nDependable Tektro brakes with adjustable reach levers, and an 11-32 ratio cassette give the 24 real versatility when it comes to when and where you want to take it.\n\nLightweight Aluminium frame and fork\n\nConfidence inspiring geometry\n\n8 Speed Shimano Acera gearing\n\nLow Q Factor = narrow pedals\n\nAdjustable short-reach brake levers\n\nKids specific saddle",
